## Milestone Rules

The scene uses relative coordinates (`~` notation), so I need to establish the absolute coordinate frame. The player spawns at position (X, Y, Z) and all commands use `~` relative to that. Let me define milestones based on the relative positions:

- **Cobblestone slabs**: Path from ~(-1,-1,2) to ~(1,-1,10) — player needs to be near Z+2 to Z+10 area
